      <ActivityOrMissionDesc>Activities promote social welfare and operated primarily to further the common good and general welfare of the people in the community by bringing about civic betterment and social improvement that is consistent with the permitted purposes. The mission is to cause greatness by mentoring men to live with excellence and, as mature masculine leaders, create successful families, careers, and communities. Specifically, the purposes for which this corporation is formed are to provide educational, social and community service opportunities for men, promote social welfare and further leadership and personal growth and competency for the general good of the community. These goals will be accomplished by promoting, teaching and leading community service projects, leadership training and relationship programs. These programs will teach men their civic and social responsibilities so they can become strong leaders within their respective communities while being positive role models to children.</ActivityOrMissionDesc>
